Postcard Info: “Goat Series.” [H. J. B.]&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Miss Ruby Chandler&lt;br&gt;
Pearl, Illinois&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Dear Ruby,&lt;br&gt;
I suppose you had an awful time to break away from Floyd. If Ruby has lots of nerve has Floyd more?&lt;br&gt;
Duffy&lt;/p&gt;</description>
